@prefix eco: <https://ggen.dev/ecosystem#> . @prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> . eco:NonStaleEvidence a skos:Concept; skos:inScheme eco:VerificationEvidenceScheme; skos:prefLabel "Non-Stale Evidence"; skos:definition "Evidence proving the observed subject still matches the exact admitted identity when verification is consumed." .